# POC runner audit

- [ ] Does the runner consume all five frozen fixture/expected pairs?
- [ ] Does it compare exact typed-edge identity, not an aggregate similarity score?
- [ ] Are scientific PASS claims separated from raw-extraction/live/scale NOT_TESTED claims?
- [ ] Does it report tree and flattened baselines without changing the source DAG?
- [ ] Does it make zero model, DB, Redis, and Solver calls?
- [ ] Is the destination append-once and assembled through a fresh partial directory?
